      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not explicitly define “pragmatics” as such; it discusses “pragmatic processing” and “neuropragmatics” (neural basis of pragmatic processing), rather than giving a direct definition of pragmatics in cognition as “processing of pragmatic information in dialogue.”",
